NOTICE — scope of this license

This license applies to all original code and documentation in this
repository — including app/, ingestion/, CHANDLEROS_BLUEPRINT.md, and
plan.md — EXCEPT the Chandleros/ directory.

Chandleros/ contains a derived personality-analysis dataset built from
dialogue drawn from the television sitcom "Friends" (Warner Bros.
Television / NBCUniversal). As documented in
Chandleros/dataset_provenance.json, that source dialogue is treated as
copyrighted, unlicensed third-party input: it is not redistributed
verbatim, and the original source file (data.parquet) is not included in
this repository. The abstracted statistical/structural artifacts in
Chandleros/ (frequency tables, structural templates, rule sets) describe
patterns found in that dataset rather than republishing it, but this MIT
grant does not extend to that directory's contents — no license is
granted here with respect to any underlying "Friends" intellectual
property, and downstream reuse of Chandleros/ should independently confirm
its provenance and copyright status before relying on it.
